    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: I have one more idea, though it may be a terrible one. I've heard that
        some perfumes are made from the scent glands of creatures, and well, nothing
        has a stronger scent than <style=enemy>stinkshrooms</style>. Maybe their
        <style=item>sticky sap</style> could work?
